---@field marginLeftSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to margin_left.
---@field useFirstPageHeaderFooterSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to use_first_page_header_footer.
---@field flipPageOrientationSuggested? boolean Optional. Indicates if there was a suggested change to flip_page_orientation.
---@field evenPageHeaderIdSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to even_page_header_id.
---@field useCustomHeaderFooterMarginsSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to use_custom_header_footer_margins.
---@field marginBottomSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to margin_bottom.
