---@field firstPageFooterIdSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to first_page_footer_id.
---@field useEvenPageHeaderFooterSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to use_even_page_header_footer.
---@field firstPageHeaderIdSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to first_page_header_id.
---@field marginRightSuggested? boolean Indicates if there was a suggested change to margin_right.
