---@field color? gcp.docs_v1.OptionalColor The color of the border.
---@field width? gcp.docs_v1.Dimension The width of the border.

---@alias gcp.docs_v1.ParagraphBorderDashStyleEnum "DASH_STYLE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SOLID"|"DOT"|"DASH"

---A ParagraphElement describes content within a Paragraph.
---@class gcp.docs_v1.ParagraphElement
---@field pageBreak? gcp.docs_v1.PageBreak A page break paragraph element.
