---A person or email address mentioned in a document. These mentions behave as a single, immutable element containing the person's name or email address.
---@class gcp.docs_v1.Person
---@field textStyle? gcp.docs_v1.TextStyle The text style of this Person.
---@field personId? string Output only. The unique ID of this link.
---@field suggestedTextStyleChanges? gcp.docs_v1.SuggestedTextStyleMap The suggested text style changes to this Person, keyed by suggestion ID.
---@field personProperties? gcp.docs_v1.PersonProperties Output only. The properties of this Person. This field is always present.
---@field suggestedInsertionIds? gcp.docs_v1.StringList IDs for suggestions that insert this person link into the document. A Person might have multiple insertion IDs if it's a nested suggested change (a suggestion within a suggestion made by a different user, for example). If empty, then this person link isn't a suggested insertion.
---@field suggestedDeletionIds? gcp.docs_v1.StringList IDs for suggestions that remove this person link from the document. A Person might have multiple deletion IDs if, for example, multiple users suggest deleting it. If empty, then this person link isn't suggested for deletion.

---Properties specific to a linked Person.
---@class gcp.docs_v1.PersonProperties
---@field name? string The name of the person if it's displayed in the link text instead of the person's email address.
---@field email? string The email address linked to this Person. This field is always present.

---Updates the number of pinned table header rows in a table.
